ck 고정 안하지 않아? 지금 말하는건 offline 실험이라니까? 제발 문맥을 잃지마\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05c95-248b-79a1-bb93-a73280c92944","create_time":1788259673.2476666,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05c97-6e6b-79b0-b4e3-d829e67aff2d","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"repeat는 1번만 해도 큰 문제 없을 거라는게 내 생각인데 어때?\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05c97-6e53-71f0-bdb0-ce89693033f6","create_time":1788259823.211441,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05d25-24f9-7b50-b2ca-0f11f6a5116e","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"아까 serving suite에 breakdown 실험에서 결과에 gpu fwd나 stall 등등 여러 측정 값 잘 나오는거 확인했지?\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05d25-2430-7772-8379-5da9ec1b9c44","create_time":1788269110.521562,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05d26-9fad-7e30-86c9-1f77eec3c3ec","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"```css\nscripts/serving/run_performance_suite.sh \\\n    --codecs p4flat,cd3 \\\n    --modes raw,kvcomp \\\n    --chunks 1024,2048,4096,8192 \\\n    --request-rates 0.8,1.0,1.2 \\\n    --repeats 1 \\\n    --breakdown\n```\n\n이렇게 돌리는거 맞지?\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05d26-9f99-7733-8c28-6cb122e11cf9","create_time":1788269207.469798,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05d28-984b-7d73-b202-152dace29731","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"이거 raw가 그냥 fused, kvcomp가 fusde + kvcomp 맞지?\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05d28-9810-7920-8089-6615e6df4d2a","create_time":1788269336.6514914,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a06177-c613-7273-9379-8a64d6f56910","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"오프라인 breakdown 실험 결과를 보고 아래 질문에 답해줘.\n\n1\\. offline breakdown 실험 결과에서 kvcomp 기준, 현 cd3 구현이 64배치에서는 p4flat